OL,4,Afling with inmate                      
OL,6,FA married prison tutor who sent naked  
OL,7,Fphotographs of herself to an inmate has
OL,8,Fbeen given a suspended jail sentence.  
OL,10,FOksana Antanaitiene's secret fling at  
OL,11,FHMP Chelmsford was uncovered when she  
OL,12,Fwas found locked in an office with the 
OL,13,Fprisoner in August 2025.               
OL,15,FStaff went on to find the 52-year-old  
OL,16,Fmaths tutor from Grays, Essex, had used
OL,17,Fa USB drive to smuggle music and TV    
OL,18,Ffiles to him, as well as the X-rated   
OL,19,Fimages.                                
